#lang rhombus
// Extended Boyer-Moore prover: started from tools/ml2rhm's translation of
// the pinned HOL Light Boyer_Moore/terms_and_clauses.ml (rhombus/hol/Boyer_Moore/ keeps the
// literal translation). Edited freely for the frontend; not a literal port.

// ****************************************************************************
// FILE          : terms_and_clauses.ml
// DESCRIPTION   : Rewriting terms and simplifying clauses.
//
// READS FILES   : <none>
// WRITES FILES  : <none>
//
// AUTHOR        : R.J.Boulton
// DATE          : 7th June 1991
//
// MODIFIED      : R.J.Boulton
// DATE          : 16th October 1992
//
// LAST MODIFIED : P. Papapanagiotou (University of Edinburgh)
// DATE          : July 2009
// ****************************************************************************

